===Verb===
{{en-verb|es}}

# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To [[tie up]] a [[bird]] before [[cook]]ing it.
# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To [[secure]] or [[bind]] with [[rope]]s.
# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To [[support]].
# To take fast hold of; to seize and hold firmly; to pounce upon.
#* Spenser
#*: who '''trussing''' me as eagle doth his prey
# To strengthen or stiffen, as a beam or girder, by means of a brace or braces.
# {{context|slang|archaic|lang=en}} To execute by hanging; to hang; usually with ''up''.
#: {{rfquotek|Sir Walter Scott}}

